1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 13]

34
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,040
Your Highness.

35
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:48,920
Lord Pei.

36
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:50,920
How are you feeling,

37
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,200
Lady Yun?

38
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,790
The imperial physician said

39
00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:55,280
I only fainted

40
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,280
from blood loss.

41
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,070
Nothing serious.

42
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,480
That is a relief.

43
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,760
Come back to the Eastern Palace with me.

44
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,480
Our physician can help you recover.

45
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,310
Your Highness.

46
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:05,560
Lady Yun is returning to Yun Mansion.

47
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,790
Of course.

48
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,590
I'll visit you tomorrow, then.

49
00:02:11,910 --> 00:02:14,030
Don't you have lessons, Your Highness?

50
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:19,110
Since when do you care about my studies?

51
00:02:20,250 --> 00:02:20,710
I wouldn't dare.

52
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:24,840
Your Highness.

53
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,870
The Noble Consort wants to see you.

54
00:02:27,030 --> 00:02:27,680
I know.

55
00:02:29,430 --> 00:02:30,470
Get some rest.

56
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,960
If you need anything,

57
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,000
send a servant to tell me.

58
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,190
Thank you, Your Highness.

59
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,130
Your Highness.

60
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:51,590
They say Yun Shao has a keen nose.

61
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:52,470
Your Highness.

62
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,710
The Noble Consort summons you.

63
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,460
I have urgent business now.

64
00:02:56,470 --> 00:02:57,260
Tell Her Highness

65
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,360
I'll visit later.

66
00:03:03,330 --> 00:03:05,970
Was Yun Shao really rescued
from Mingyu's dungeon?

67
00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:08,400
I saw it myself.

68
00:03:09,570 --> 00:03:10,820
Stay out of trouble.

69
00:03:11,430 --> 00:03:12,850
If Pei Zhao hadn't been there,

70
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:14,430
things could've gone badly.

71
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,960
Learn more from Pei Zhao.

72
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:17,860
Mother Consort.

73
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:19,240
I have matters to attend to.

74
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:20,560
I shall take my leave.

75
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,630
Every time I mention him,

76
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:23,560
you leave.

77
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:25,780
No matter how capable Pei Zhao is,

78
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,280
he'll still serve you one day.

79
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,120
You're the Crown Prince.

80
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,150
Don't be so petty.

81
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,310
And Prince of Xin'an.

82
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,960
He knows warfare well.

83
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,360
I have sent word to him.

84
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:38,110
He will come teach you.

85
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,190
I won't learn from him.

86
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:41,590
Can anyone be my teacher now?

87
00:03:42,590 --> 00:03:44,080
He only has a few war merits.

88
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,310
Yet he dares lecture me in court.

89
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:49,470
I'll take my leave.

90
00:03:51,820 --> 00:03:53,360
So narrow-minded.

91
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,050
Who will ever serve you?

92
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,280
Your Highness.

93
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,400
Prince of Xin'an left the palace.

94
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,520
He said he had urgent business.

95
00:03:59,510 --> 00:04:00,680
None of them

96
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:02,300
listen to me.

97
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,680
Tell Prince of Xin'an

98
00:04:03,970 --> 00:04:05,120
to get over here.

99
00:04:05,910 --> 00:04:06,560
Yes.

100
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:14,870
How is she?

101
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:15,840
She's fine.

102
00:04:16,270 --> 00:04:17,830
Just some pent-up stress.

103
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:19,070
A few days' rest will do.

104
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:20,270
I'll write a prescription.

105
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:26,830
I told you I'm fine.

106
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:27,750
No.

107
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:28,950
You look pale.

108
00:04:29,390 --> 00:04:30,240
Don't go back to Yun Mansion.

109
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,310
Come back to Fengyi Bureau with me.

110
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:34,680
The Yun family is our only lead.

111
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,070
For the case and for myself,

112
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:37,160
I have to go back.

113
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,830
I want the killer caught.

114
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:40,360
For me,

115
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:41,950
for Yun Xiang,

116
00:04:42,450 --> 00:04:44,270
and for all those dead girls.

117
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:45,830
Sir.

118
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,190
It can't stay dark forever.

119
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,510
Our blood can't be shed for nothing.

120
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:52,310
Dangerous places

121
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,800
are where Fengyi Guards belong.

122
00:04:54,310 --> 00:04:55,000
Have you forgotten?

123
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,190
I'm a Fengyi Guard too.

124
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,360
Then don't forget

125
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,680
your life is tied to mine.

126
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,750
If you risk yours,

127
00:04:59,870 --> 00:05:01,000
mine is at even greater risk.

128
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:09,270
I'll protect myself.

129
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:14,060
[Yun Mansion]

130
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:15,190
Shao is alive?

131
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:17,090
Where has she been hiding?

132
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:18,680
She actually posed

133
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,320
as a female guard with Pei Zhao.

134
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:24,660
[Madam Yun, Yun Zhanpeng's Wife]
She's already met His Majesty.

135
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,390
I'm afraid

136
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:27,040
we can't touch her now.

137
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,720
We have to.

138
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,040
Master.

139
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:32,630
Madam.

140
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:33,830
The younger lady is back.

141
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:34,950
Huh?

142
00:05:36,730 --> 00:05:36,950
What?

143
00:05:49,620 --> 00:05:50,410
Shao.

144
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:52,000
You're finally back.

145
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,270
Who is this lady?

146
00:05:56,300 --> 00:05:57,490
I'm your mother.

147
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,040
Don't you remember?

148
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,390
Shao.

149
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,240
I've searched everywhere for you.

150
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:08,680
All this time,

151
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,750
where have you been?

152
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,600
Sister?

153
00:06:12,190 --> 00:06:13,480
Who's my sister?

154
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,800
Shao.

155
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,360
You really don't remember me?

156
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,430
No.

157
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,210
Let's go home.

158
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:24,790
Let's go.

159
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,190
You're so skilled, my lady.

160
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,280
Your bracelets are the finest.

161
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:20,600
Look what I made.

162
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,160
I'm getting better, right?

163
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,000
I made you

164
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,240
a Flowering Rite gift.

165
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,800
After the rite,

166
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:46,920
we'll

167
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,830
go see a play,

168
00:07:48,310 --> 00:07:49,680
then release floating lanterns,

169
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:51,480
and visit the City God Temple

170
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,310
to pray

171
00:07:53,310 --> 00:07:54,750
for a fine husband for you.

172
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:57,630
You'll live well with him,

173
00:07:57,630 --> 00:07:58,510
travel far and wide,

174
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:00,190
and buy tons of spices.

175
00:08:01,270 --> 00:08:01,950
Then,

176
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,720
I'll pray that Yun Xiang

177
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,920
will always be happy.

178
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:13,620
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

179
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:19,850
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

180
00:08:25,490 --> 00:08:29,150
Yun Xiang, I'll get justice for you.

181
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,390
What are you doing, Yun Shao?

182
00:08:40,150 --> 00:08:40,610
Brother.

183
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:41,810
I'm praying.

184
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,440
In the dungeon,

185
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,390
I swore to the moon every night

186
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,600
that if I ever found my way home,

187
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,630
I'd burn incense and pray,

188
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:56,960
build the Moon Goddess

189
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:57,840
a golden statue,

190
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,030
and enshrine her forever.

191
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:02,240
Remember your maid Yun Xiang?

192
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:04,270
She's dead.

193
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,240
Who's Yun Xiang?

194
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:10,320
Your maid.

195
00:09:11,670 --> 00:09:13,150
She failed to serve you

196
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:14,030
and let you suffer.

197
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,670
So I killed her myself,

198
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:17,510
cut out her tongue,

199
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:20,360
and used her blood for a Blood Banquet.

200
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,390
Brother, stop.

201
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,080
What's a Blood Banquet?

202
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,360
That sounds scary.

203
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,120
Sir.

204
00:09:27,910 --> 00:09:29,150
She can handle it.

205
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,030
Chang'an is there.

206
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:30,790
Don't worry.

207
00:09:31,690 --> 00:09:33,120
We should find the truth quickly

208
00:09:33,540 --> 00:09:35,060
so she can leave the Yun family sooner.

209
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:43,750
Whether you're faking or really forgot,

210
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:45,270
just stay put.

211
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,070
Or I'll send you to Blood Banquet too.

212
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,750
Fainted again?

213
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:02,440
Did she really lose her memory?

214
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:04,720
Whether she lost it or not,

215
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:05,630
it doesn't matter.

216
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,390
What matters is that she's back.

217
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:09,360
The work at the mine can't wait.

218
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:10,840
Hurry back.

219
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:11,600
Yes.

220
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:21,030
Father.

221
00:10:21,620 --> 00:10:23,090
Pei Zhao hid Yun Shao from us.

222
00:10:23,090 --> 00:10:23,900
He's clearly up to something.

223
00:10:24,420 --> 00:10:25,910
Let's report him to His Majesty.

224
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:27,510
With what?

225
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,390
Idiot.

226
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:31,030
She was right in front of you

227
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:32,820
and neither of you noticed.

228
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,630
Father.

229
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,240
It's not Brother's fault.

230
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,670
Shao was always frail.

231
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,270
That female guard

232
00:10:40,690 --> 00:10:41,790
could fight

233
00:10:41,790 --> 00:10:42,670
and even kill.

234
00:10:44,630 --> 00:10:45,480
If anyone's to blame,

235
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,870
it's Shao for acting too well.

236
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,510
Forget the past.

237
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:52,270
We need a way

238
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:54,260
to get Shao's blood.

239
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,080
That's so irritating.

240
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:10,990
How dare they do that to her?

241
00:11:11,630 --> 00:11:12,630
I'll finish you all.

242
00:11:19,270 --> 00:11:19,710
Your Highness.

243
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,590
Everyone praises Pei Zhao.

244
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:26,080
Why not make him Crown Prince instead?

245
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,750
If you hate Pei Zhao,

246
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,670
why did you cover for him

247
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:29,630
in court that day?

248
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,030
That Yun Shao

249
00:11:31,030 --> 00:11:32,960
was clearly Guard Xu.

250
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,080
That's why I need to know

251
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,000
what he's planning.

252
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:38,360
Don't forget,

253
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,490
the Yun family serves Noble Consort.

254
00:11:40,490 --> 00:11:41,840
Not me.

255
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:42,840
Mind your words, Your Highness.

256
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,520
Mind my words?

257
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,510
It's been 18 years.

258
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:46,320
She raised me.

259
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,270
I'm grateful.

260
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,290
But she can't control everything I do.

261
00:11:49,790 --> 00:11:50,750
I'm eighteen.

262
00:11:50,750 --> 00:11:52,000
Not eight.

263
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:54,790
And that Prince of Xin'an.

264
00:11:55,630 --> 00:11:57,240
Who does he think he is?

265
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:59,630
Lecturing me before the whole court.

266
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,080
He commands a huge army.

267
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:03,270
Noble Consort wants him in your service.

268
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,120
I'll have my own army one day.

269
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:06,870
I don't need him.

270
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,630
What a brute.

271
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,630
Enough.

272
00:12:13,390 --> 00:12:14,870
Prepare a generous gift.

273
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:16,590
I'm going to Yun Mansion.

274
00:12:16,910 --> 00:12:17,670
Today?

275
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:18,960
Right now.

276
00:12:19,750 --> 00:12:20,390
Yes.

277
00:12:24,910 --> 00:12:26,790
Quit pretending already?

278
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,750
I don't care if you've really forgotten

279
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:49,240
or you're faking it.

280
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,360
Now that you're back,

281
00:12:53,030 --> 00:12:54,440
behave.

282
00:12:55,030 --> 00:12:56,270
Stop causing trouble.

283
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,750
What a wonderful sister you are.

284
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,080
Zhao.

285
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,670
I'm only angry she kept running off

286
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:08,150
and worrying everyone.

287
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:10,000
Worry about yourself.

288
00:13:10,510 --> 00:13:10,840
Yun Shao.

289
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:11,390
Let's go.

290
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:13,840
Zhao.

291
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,030
Where are you taking her?

292
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:17,600
She's my sister.

293
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,440
She stays here.

294
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:21,390
She's the only witness
in the Mingyu case.

295
00:13:21,630 --> 00:13:23,120
I'm taking her back for questioning.

296
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:24,080
Step aside.

297
00:13:30,750 --> 00:13:31,750
Zhao.

298
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,080
Where are you taking her?

299
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:33,670
My future son-in-law.

300
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:37,080
You're marrying Heng soon.

301
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,720
Why are you holding Shao?

302
00:13:39,390 --> 00:13:39,870
Lord Yun.

303
00:13:40,390 --> 00:13:41,240
His Majesty ordered me

304
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,550
to marry a Yun daughter.

305
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:43,750
But the Yun family

306
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:45,630
has more than one.

307
00:13:48,750 --> 00:13:49,240
Huh?

308
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:49,720
What?

309
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:50,600
Pei Zhao.

310
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:51,870
What do you mean?

311
00:13:52,630 --> 00:13:55,440
The Imperial Edict clearly says
you're marrying me.

312
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:56,720
Lady Yun,

313
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:58,440
you read it wrong.

314
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:03,720
Your Highness.

315
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:06,270
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

316
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,240
No need.

317
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:26,840
Well,

318
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,240
your family is reunited.

319
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:29,390
Congratulations.

320
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:32,030
Thank you, Your Highness.

321
00:14:43,550 --> 00:14:45,120
My lady, you have a visitor.

322
00:14:45,630 --> 00:14:46,030
Let him in.

323
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:50,670
Chang'an.

324
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:52,440
Welcome.

325
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,000
Lady Yun.

326
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,030
This is from my lord.

327
00:15:00,870 --> 00:15:01,670
He said

328
00:15:01,930 --> 00:15:03,130
you may stay at Yun Mansion,

329
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:05,790
but be careful.

330
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:09,360
The dagger is sharp.

331
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:11,390
Be careful, Lady Yun.

332
00:15:12,790 --> 00:15:13,360
Chang'an.

333
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,150
Why so formal with me?

334
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:16,240
You are younger than me.

335
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,150
Just call me Sister.

336
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,390
I can't.

337
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,030
You're the younger Lady Yun.

338
00:15:22,670 --> 00:15:23,790
That's inappropriate.

339
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:24,870
Nonsense.

340
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,150
Just call me Sister.

341
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:27,750
I wouldn't dare.

342
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,120
I shouldn't have told you.

343
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:33,550
Now you're acting all awkward.

344
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,390
This incense tube

345
00:15:37,550 --> 00:15:38,320
is for Lord Pei.

346
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,240
As for these three,

347
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:48,200
each of you gets one.

348
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:57,720
Xiao Ruoming.

349
00:15:59,030 --> 00:15:59,630
Killed in action.

350
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:01,670
Ruoming.

351
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,270
There aren't three of us anymore.

352
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,120
We don't need the third.

353
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,270
Who is it?

354
00:16:57,820 --> 00:16:58,480
Come back.

355
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:09,740
[Tianyi Brewery]

356
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,270
Who are we looking for?

357
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:24,220
Sir.

358
00:17:24,590 --> 00:17:26,880
This is the rebels' base in the capital.

359
00:17:30,590 --> 00:17:31,590
These winemakers

360
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:33,200
escaped from the Blood Jade Mine.

361
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,070
They might

362
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:36,400
know the man you're looking for.

363
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:37,720
Rebels?

364
00:17:57,110 --> 00:17:59,920
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

365
00:18:01,540 --> 00:18:04,730
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

366
00:18:06,050 --> 00:18:07,790
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

367
00:18:08,290 --> 00:18:12,730
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

368
00:18:14,890 --> 00:18:17,560
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

369
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:23,790
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

370
00:18:24,110 --> 00:18:32,140
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

371
00:18:32,410 --> 00:18:41,030
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

372
00:18:41,030 --> 00:18:49,700
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

373
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:58,950
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

374
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:07,870
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
